Construct includes material adapted from the Gentle AI project
(https://github.com/Gentleman-Programming/gentle-ai), used under the MIT License below.

Adapted material:
- agents/review-risk.md, review-readability.md, review-reliability.md,
  review-resilience.md, review-refuter.md, jd-judge-a.md, jd-judge-b.md,
  jd-fix-agent.md
- skills/branch-pr, chained-pr, cognitive-doc-design, comment-writer,
  go-testing, judgment-day, skill-creator, skill-improver, work-unit-commits
- skills/codegraph (adapted from the CodeGraph guidance)
- skills/odd-workflow, odd-delegation, task-size-risk, lossless-prompts and
  hooks/contract/session.md, subagent.md (condensed from the orchestrator,
  routing, research, and persistence guidance)
- skills/rdd-review (adapted from the review ledger guidance: consent per
  candidate, lens selection by consequence, one bounded correction)

The adapted files were modified for Construct: product-specific commands,
registry references, and per-agent managed blocks were removed or replaced,
and agent names were namespaced for the plugin.

